    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well... I don't know if you can come in handy, it seems that there is still a gap!",
      "translation" : "嗯...我不確定你能不能幫上忙，看來還差一點條件！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you become stronger, come back to me. You should be almost level 135!",
      "translation" : "等你變強一些再來找我。你的等級應該快到135級了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^ff0000Taming monsters will impede progress in this dungeon. Please take note of this.^000000",
      "translation" : "^ff0000在這個地下城馴服怪物會妨礙探索進度，請注意。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are a lot of interesting things about the ancient civilizations in this area.",
      "translation" : "這個地區的古代文明有很多有趣之處。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Observing the soil strata it is estimated to be 500 to 600 years old!",
      "translation" : "根據土層觀察結果，這裡大約有500到600年曆史！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But many of the excavated objects here already far surpass our current technology.",
      "translation" : "不過，這裡挖掘出的許多物品都遠遠超出了我們現有的科技水平。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "A lot of undefined terms are found in the recovered records as well.",
      "translation" : "在出土記錄中還發現了許多含義不明的詞語。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What kind of unknown terms?",
      "translation" : "什麼樣的未知詞語？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffMother Computer^000000 or, ^0000ff LSI Chip^000000 Or, and what else. ^0000ffChicken^000000?",
      "translation" : "^0000ff母型電腦^000000、^0000ffLSI晶片^000000，還有什麼來著？^0000ff雞^000000？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Mm that's right. There definitely was the word Chicken. I don't know what kind of combination of technology that may be...",
      "translation" : "嗯，沒錯。記錄裡確實有“雞”這個詞。我不知道那會是怎樣的科技組合..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is referrenced in the records of people who seem to 'root' amongst the many traces of technology.",
      "translation" : "記錄中提到了那些似乎在眾多科技遺蹟中“紮根”的人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is not a topic I would be interested in.",
      "translation" : "這不是我感興趣的話題。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Interesting. Have there been any results?",
      "translation" : "真有意思，有什麼研究成果嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Unfortunate.",
      "translation" : "很遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "My aim is to research the use of technology related to the relevant times. Even though what I have found out so far is insignificant.",
      "translation" : "我的目標是研究與那個時代相關的科技用途。雖然到目前為止，研究成果還微不足道。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If I had it my way I would use the dimension mover to see for myself but there's too much work. Besides I am not an adventurer...",
      "translation" : "如果可以，我真想用次元移動裝置親自去看看，可是工作太多了。而且我又不是冒險者..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Civilization Explorer]",
      "translation" : "[文明探索家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Civilization Explorer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "By any chance, would you interested in traveling to the past?",
      "translation" : "你有沒有興趣去一趟過去？"
